           <td style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:bottom;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_0741005a-0d8b-4754-ae1c-0edb7d18afc6" contextRef="C_5b231c07-4f5f-43b1-a408-a801816797de" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife" format="ixt-sec:duryear"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">3</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;to </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_d6f4a1fe-2809-4d87-a1d3-4758a50ffed9" contextRef="C_a9af77d3-e734-4b1b-a360-efe70d95801d" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife" format="ixt-sec:duryear"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">7</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p></td>
