font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Advertising Costs</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Advertising costs are expensed as incurred and included in SG&amp;A expenses. UNIFI&#8217;s advertising costs include spending for items such as consumer marketing and branding initiatives, promotional items, trade shows, sponsorships, and other programs.  </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_622ccdaa-500b-4a00-b282-5f84b5aa029e" contextRef="C_8c0bda07-3204-484c-a5cb-580909f1185d" name="ufi:ScheduleOfAdvertisingCostsTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_622ccdaa-500b-4a00-b282-5f84b5aa029e_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Advertising costs were as follows:</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><div style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:continuation id="F_622ccdaa-500b-4a00-b282-5f84b5aa029e_1" continuedAt="F_622ccdaa-500b-4a00-b282-5f84b5aa029e_2"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p>
