ning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_af439910-ace9-40c3-ad1b-1d26888ba09e" contextRef="C_ba7e0ece-23f3-4a69-80d9-d39499ad62f0" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">349</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> RSUs, and </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_c49855f4-547e-4d66-9d09-b58332276680" contextRef="C_6a47d468-3184-4492-b373-b8ad43b6fce7" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">255</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_9afb38f9-8630-4ab2-8dc6-92b09cb7189a" contextRef="C_8b52823a-81e7-4928-9f95-fbfdc9bd841c" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">189</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, and </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_07ebf5a6-604c-4aee-aa1c-1d0fbed68b5c" contextRef="C_e86d480e-6039-4b51-af62-63eb23feec81" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">212</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> PSUs, respectively, as equity units to certain key employees. The weighted average grant-date fair value of RSUs granted during fiscal 2026, 2025, and 2024 was $</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_bd7c31d5-6338-41fa-addc-a3d62d6e1593" contextRef="C_c734222e-7758-452c-9fbe-8dc8be43110c" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2">3.29</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, $</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_a5ed17e4-65a2-4193-8151-66cc911fe321" contextRef="C_c5128ab2-6a9f-48ca-9d66-e88620b748e8" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2">6.85</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, and $</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_d931a683-10aa-40b8-8528-73a6abe44087" contextRef="C_ba7e0ece-23f3-4a69-80d9-d39499ad62f0" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2">6.43</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> per share, respectively. The weighted average grant-date fair value of PSUs granted during fiscal 2026, 2025, and 2024 was $</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_6f3e1081-b2fa-49b3-8faa-7f3b00f1ccda" contextRef="C_6a47d468-3184-4492-b373-b8ad43b6fce7" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.29</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, $</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_6e4f82b3-1dc7-4713-b660-61c49c135a83" contextRef="C_8b52823a-81e7-4928-9f95-fbfdc9bd841c" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6.94</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, and $</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_7746432b-35e1-4c55-b183-42d5888e7e0f" contextRef="C_e86d480e-6039-4b51-af62-63eb23feec81" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6.47</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> per share, respectively.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">During fiscal 2026, UNIFI also granted </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ebafd825-bc7c-47e0-933c-2d28ccaafa16" contextRef="C_6a5eba3b-66dd-4d0a-99e5-e250dadbe547" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">24</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> RSUs and </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_d4fd2b67-de9c-4e13-99d1-1774f766b9a2" contextRef="C_a36266bf-844d-4f3d-8358-bc562b1968dd" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">24</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> PSUs as cash units. Grants of cash units in fiscal 2025 and 2024 are not significant. The weighted average grant date fair value for cash units granted during fiscal 2026 was $</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_7c648689-e9c9-40b2-9d47-32f7b8d9bd8d" contextRef="C_c8050724-61b3-4517-b81a-1ad5534a1281" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.29</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Equity units are accounted for as equity awards. Equity units are measured based on the fair value of Common Stock on the award&#8217;s grant date. </span><span><ix:nonNumeric id="F_54ef8dc6-0038-46cd-a072-3a047ddbca38" contextRef="C_8c0bda07-3204-484c-a5cb-580909f1185d" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationPerformanceSharesAwardUnvestedActivityTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_54ef8dc6-0038-46cd-a072-3a047ddbca38_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">A summary of activity of equity units for fiscal 2026 is as follows:</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><div style="font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:continuation id="F_54ef8dc6-0038-46cd-a072-3a047ddbca38_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p>
